# フェーズ 1: 昇順・降順気味・ばらばらの順で 9000 行を入れて B+Tree を分割させる（キーは text が 300 バイトで 1 ページに 20 件ほど）。
# 副索引は DESC NULLS FIRST。

statement ok
CREATE TABLE m4r_bg_t (k int PRIMARY KEY, s text NOT NULL, v int)

statement ok
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX m4r_bg_t_s ON m4r_bg_t (s)

statement ok
CREATE INDEX m4r_bg_t_v ON m4r_bg_t (v DESC NULLS FIRST)

# 昇順
statement count 3000
INSERT INTO m4r_bg_t SELECT g, lpad(g::text, 300, '0'), g % 50 FROM generate_series(1, 3000) g

# 降順に近い順（6000 ... 3001）。v は NULL を混ぜる
statement count 3000
INSERT INTO m4r_bg_t SELECT 9001 - g, lpad((9001 - g)::text, 300, '0'), CASE WHEN g % 10 = 0 THEN NULL ELSE g % 50 END FROM generate_series(1, 3000) g

# ばらばらの順（3001 ... 6000 の置換）
statement count 3000
INSERT INTO m4r_bg_t SELECT 3001 + (g * 7) % 3000, lpad((3001 + (g * 7) % 3000)::text, 300, '0'), g % 50 FROM generate_series(1, 3000) g

# --- 索引走査（enable_seqscan = off）と全走査の件数・合計が一致する
statement ok
SET enable_seqscan = off

query III
SELECT count(*), min(k), max(k) FROM m4r_bg_t
----
9000 1 9000

query II
SELECT count(*), sum(v) FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE k BETWEEN 100 AND 7000
----
6901 167050

query II
SELECT count(*), sum(k) FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE v = 7
----
180 811560

query I
SELECT count(*) FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE v IS NULL
----
300

query II
SELECT k, length(s) FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE s = lpad('4321', 300, '0')
----
4321 300

query I
SELECT k FROM m4r_bg_t ORDER BY k DESC LIMIT 3
----
9000
8999
8998

query I
SELECT k FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE k >= 2990 ORDER BY k LIMIT 4
----
2990
2991
2992
2993

statement ok
RESET enable_seqscan

statement ok
SET enable_indexscan = off

statement ok
SET enable_bitmapscan = off

query III
SELECT count(*), min(k), max(k) FROM m4r_bg_t
----
9000 1 9000

query II
SELECT count(*), sum(v) FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE k BETWEEN 100 AND 7000
----
6901 167050

query II
SELECT count(*), sum(k) FROM m4r_bg_t WHERE v = 7
----
180 811560

statement ok
RESET enable_indexscan

statement ok
RESET enable_bitmapscan

# --- 一意性（PRIMARY KEY と UNIQUE INDEX）
statement error (23505)
INSERT INTO m4r_bg_t VALUES (4321, 'dup-pk', 0)

statement error (23505)
INSERT INTO m4r_bg_t VALUES (-1, lpad('4321', 300, '0'), 0)
